  "description": "Welcome to Villa Joline, a beautifully renovated 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom villa full of charm, character, and relaxed bohemian style. Perfectly located in the heart of Nueva Andalucía, this cozy yet stylish villa offers the ideal balance of privacy, comfort, and convenience for families or groups looking to enjoy Marbella’s vibrant lifestyle.\n\nRecently renovated, the villa combines fresh modern touches with warm bohemian-inspired interiors, creating a welcoming and laid-back atmosphere throughout the home. The living spaces are bright and comfortable, designed for relaxing after long sunny days on the Costa del Sol.\n\nOutside, guests can enjoy a private swimming pool and outdoor areas perfect for sunbathing, dining, or spending quality time with friends and family in complete privacy.\n\nOne of Villa Joline’s biggest highlights is its unbeatable location. Just minutes away on foot, you’ll find shops, supermarkets, cafés, bars, and restaurants, while the popular Aloha Strip is only a short stroll further, offering some of Nueva Andalucía’s best dining and nightlife spots. Beaches, golf courses, and Puerto Banús are also just a short drive away.\n\nThe property also offers convenient street parking directly outside the villa.\n\nVilla Joline is the perfect choice for guests looking for a stylish and relaxed Marbella stay in one of the area’s most desirable locations.\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a bit more about yourself and the group that you will be travelling with so we can request this for you.",
